1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,059
What does an online store in Uzbekistan need to accept card payments?

2
00:00:04,059 --> 00:00:14,488
By law, only banks and payment organizations licensed by the Central Bank can connect to card processing centers like Uzcard, Humo, Visa and Mastercard, not stores.

3
00:00:14,488 --> 00:00:18,333
So an acquirer has to sit between the store and the processing center.

4
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:23,559
A bank acquirer takes the card on its own secure page, and the store never sees the card number.

5
00:00:23,559 --> 00:00:28,345
The store signs one contract and gets paid into its own account at the same bank.

